GoPro GPR files are decoded with the VC-5 decoder of the GoPro GPR SDK
(https://github.com/gopro/gpr; vc5_decoder, vc5_common), compiled into the
library when LIBRAW_ENABLE_GPR_SDK is set: (C) Copyright 2018 GoPro Inc,
licensed under Apache License 2.0 or MIT license, compiled with the
modifications in GoPro/gpr-vc5-hardening.patch. The alternative decoder
src/decoders/vc5.cpp (LIBRAW_ENABLE_GPR) is derived from the same code.

The Sony lossless ARW tile decoder comes from upstream pull request #886 and is
distributed under LibRaw's two licenses.

JPEG XL compressed DNG is decoded with libjxl (BSD 3-clause), linked as a
separate library.
